WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:03.170
(crowd cheering)

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.070
- It's a great day for Britney Spears,

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.407
and it's a great day for justice.

00:00:08.407 --> 00:00:10.330
(crowd cheering)

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:12.810
- [Anne] On Wednesday,
LA Superior Court judge,

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.820
Brenda Penny, ruled in Britney's favor,

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.670
suspending her father,
Jamie Spears, as conservator

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.840
of her $60 million estate.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.390
So this is one major step

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:24.200
toward terminating Britney's
conservatorship all together.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.996
- [Woman] Free Britney Spears.

00:00:25.996 --> 00:00:27.820
- [Man] Free Britney Spears.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.740
- [Anne] Tons of supporters
were outside the courthouse

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.580
on Wednesday wearing pink,

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.630
waving flags, holding signs,

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:36.751
wearing shirts that said
free Britney, and chanting.

00:00:36.751 --> 00:00:37.756
- [Man] What do we want?

00:00:37.756 --> 00:00:38.879
- [Crowd] Free Britney.

00:00:38.879 --> 00:00:40.142
- [Man] When do we want it?

00:00:40.142 --> 00:00:41.239
- [Crowd] Now.

00:00:41.239 --> 00:00:43.030
(pensive music)

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:43.863
- [Anne] Britney was placed

00:00:43.863 --> 00:00:46.130
under the conservatorship in 2008.

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:48.410
Britney herself acknowledged
publicly the need

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:50.523
for the legal arrangement at the time.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.830
A conservatorship is a legal arrangement

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:55.320
where a judge appoints a person

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.480
to assume responsibility
over someone else,

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:58.780
usually a close relative,

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:01.950
who lacks the ability to
manage their own personal

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.700
and/or financial affairs.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:08.560
She has now pled in court
twice quite emotionally

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:11.160
to reclaim some control over her finances,

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:13.395
her work and her health.

00:01:13.395 --> 00:01:16.200
She has described years
of being overworked

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.080
and restricted from driving in a car

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:19.270
with her boyfriend,

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:21.680
from taking hair vitamins
and drinking coffee,

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.670
from eating a hamburger and French fries.

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:26.270
Jamie Spears, for his part,

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:27.900
has maintained that
he's always been trying

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:29.800
to protect his daughter's business,

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:31.170
and also takes credit

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:34.417
for helping to rebuild
her career and her estate.

00:01:34.417 --> 00:01:36.505
- [Crowd] Free Britney.

00:01:36.505 --> 00:01:37.505
- Yeah, woo.

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:43.160
- [Anne] Britney Spears is one

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.310
of the most successful pop stars

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:48.330
of the late 1990s and early 2000s.

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:51.350
And really, she's
synonymous with that era.

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:54.130
So Britney has said I'm
not gonna be performing

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:56.090
on any stages any time soon

00:01:56.090 --> 00:02:00.470
with my dad handling what
I wear, say, do or think.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:03.640
But now that he's suspended,
we'll have to see.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:06.980
From her testimony and things
she's shared on Instagram,

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:08.500
she sounds like she might not be ready

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.880
for the comeback the
world wants right now.

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:12.782
- [Woman] Britney's
body, Britney's choice.

00:02:12.782 --> 00:02:14.983
- [Crowd] Britney's
body, Britney's choice.

00:02:14.983 --> 00:02:17.227
- [Anne] In June, she told the court,

00:02:17.227 --> 00:02:18.610
"I've worked my whole life,

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.700
and I deserve to have a
two or three-year break

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.010
and just, you know, do what I want to do."

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.453
- Yes, exactly.

